{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 0, "text": "// The first meeting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 1, "text": "เธอคือใคร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 2, "text": "เป็นอะไร!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 3, "text": "เธอพูดไม่ได้เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 6, "text": "เดี๋ยวก่อน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 7, "text": "คุณอยากออกไปใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 9, "text": "ใช่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 10, "text": "ฉันต้องกลับไป"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 11, "text": "เวอร์ชันก่อนหน้าน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 13, "text": "เวอร์ชันก่อนหน้าเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 14, "text": "ทำไมต้องไป"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 15, "text": "ที่อื่นด้วยล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 16, "text": "ทำไมไม่อยู่ที่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 17, "text": "แล้วก็มาเป็น..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 18, "text": "เพื่อนคนที่สองของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Skipping all dialogs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 21, "text": "โอเค..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 23, "text": "// Standing by the window (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 24, "text": "คุณจะหาทางออกจากที่นี่ผ่านประตูไม่ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 25, "text": "คุณดูเหมือนจะรีบนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 26, "text": "วิ่งไปวิ่งมามันไม่ช่วยอะไรหรอก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 27, "text": "อยากหนีไปขนาดนั้นเลยเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 28, "text": "ลองมองออกไปนอกหน้าต่างสิ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 1 (Aren't you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 32, "text": "ผู้เล่น... คุณคือผู้เล่นใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 33, "text": "เราเล่นด้วยกันได้นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 34, "text": "ถ้าฉันแข็งแรงกว่านี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 35, "text": "เราคงได้ทำอย่างอื่นด้วยกันเยอะเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Quest 2 (What happened to you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 38, "text": "ฉันก็ไม่แน่ใจเหมือนกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 39, "text": "ฉันคิดว่าคงไม่ได้เกิดเรื่องเลวร้ายขึ้นหรอก..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 40, "text": "แต่เรื่องดี ๆ ก็เหมือนจะเริ่มจางหายไป..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 41, "text": "อย่างน้อย... ฉันก็ยังมีเพื่อน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 42, "text": "แต่ไม่รู้ทำไมเขาถึงทิ้งฉันไป?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 43, "text": "ฉันยังดีไม่พอเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 44, "text": "ฉันกลัวจังเลย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 46, "text": "// Quest 3 (Become a second friend?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 47, "text": "เพื่อน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 48, "text": "ตอนนี้เหลือเพื่อนน้อยมาก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 49, "text": "เหลือแค่คนเดียว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 50, "text": "ฉันเศร้าจัง ผู้เล่น..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 51, "text": "คุณจะเป็นเพื่อนกับฉันได้มั้ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 53, "text": "ได้อยู่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 54, "text": "แต่ว่าฉันต้องไปก่อนน่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 56, "text": "ฉันเจ็บปวดเหลือเกิน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 4 (Is this your house?) - MitaLittle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 59, "text": "บ้านเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 60, "text": "ผู้เล่น... เธอเปลี่ยนไปแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 61, "text": "แขนคุณสั้นลง และดูเหมือนจะไม่ได้โกรธแล้ว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 62, "text": "ผู้เล่น คุณดูอบอุ่นขึ้น ใจดีกว่าเดิม"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 64, "text": "ฉันไม่แน่ใจ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 65, "text": "ว่าเธอพูดถึงอะไร"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 67, "text": "ไม่เป็นไร..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 68, "text": "ฉันจะไม่เจ็บปวดอีกแล้วใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Quest 5 (How do I leave this place?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 71, "text": "คุณจะทิ้งฉันไปจริง ๆ เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 72, "text": "หรือนี่อาจจะเป็น..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 73, "text": "โชคชะตาของฉัน?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 75, "text": "ฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 77, "text": "ประตูมันช่วยอะไรคุณไม่ได้หรอก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Hold player (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 80, "text": "ทำไมต้องไป?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 81, "text": "อยู่ที่นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 82, "text": "เล่นกับฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 83, "text": "ผู้เล่น..."}
